  "post_content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">Finalmente han sido tres las personas heridas leves poco antes de las 8 de la ma&ntilde;ana de este viernes, un hombre por peque&ntilde;as quemaduras y una mujer y un joven tambi&eacute;n por inhalaci&oacute;n de humo t&oacute;xico, de las que han sido atendiadas en el Hospital de la Plana, tras declararse un incendio en la f&aacute;brica Ba&ntilde;os 10, situada en Onda, en la carretera hacia Vila-real.</span></span></p><div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendibanos10110714/img_9722.jpg\" alt=\"img_9722\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendibanos10110714/img_9724.jpg\" alt=\"img_9724\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendibanos10110714/img_9725.jpg\" alt=\"img_9725\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendibanos10110714/img_9726.jpg\" alt=\"img_9726\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendibanos10110714/img_9727.jpg\" alt=\"img_9727\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendibanos10110714/img_9728.jpg\" alt=\"img_9728\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendibanos10110714/img_9729.jpg\" alt=\"img_9729\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendibanos10110714/img_9730.jpg\" alt=\"img_9730\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendibanos10110714/img_9731.jpg\" alt=\"img_9731\" style=\"max-width:100%;heig